<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_IV__cl_17__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where a data recipient arranges for any third party to conduct any data migration, data integration or data analytics work using the shared data under this Act, the data recipient shall ensure that the consent of the data provider is obtained before the data is handled by such third party."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
