<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "the agency in charge of the public services referred to in Clause (1) of Article 132 of the Federal Constitution, except the services referred to in paragraphs (f) and (g); and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
