<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall be read together with the provisions of other written laws which allow for data sharing to be made, subject to the conditions provided under such laws, and the provisions of this Act shall be in addition to, and not in derogation of, the provisions of the relevant written laws."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
