<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who shares data under this Act is deemed to have made such disclosure pursuant to the provisions specified in column (3) under the laws specified in column (2) of the Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
