<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any data of the public sector agency shall be dealt with in accordance with the Official Secrets Act 1972 [Act 88] and any directives relating to the security of official document issued by the Government."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
