<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_V__cl_22> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this Act, a police officer not below the rank of sergeant shall have all the powers of a police officer of whatever rank as provided for in the Criminal Procedure Code [Act 593] relating to enforcement, inspection and investigation of any offence under this Act. Obligation of secrecy"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
