<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_V__cl_25> <https://schema.org/text> "No prosecution for an offence under this Act shall be instituted except by or with the written consent of the Public Prosecutor. Liability of director, etc., of statutory body"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_V__cl_26> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_V__cl_26__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
