<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_V__cl_26__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "may be charged severally or jointly in the same proceedings with the statutory body; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
