<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@/~part_V__cl_27> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, subject to such conditions or restrictions as he may consider necessary or expedient to impose, exempt any person or class of persons from any or all of the provisions of this Act. Power to give directions"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/60/eng@> .
